  "details": "The ability to generate AssetBundles for certain assets shared between worlds could reduce VRChat hosting bandwidth usage and user downloads. That would be beneficial. I personally work on a few worlds that share assets so being able to create AssetBundles for those shared assets would allow the footprint of these worlds to be reduced. \n\nI could even create more complex worlds worrying less about the hosting/user download amount meaning more size could be dedicated to lightmapping data or normal maps which I use sparingly due to the already enormous file size of some of my worlds.",
